* T2 fixture: DEFINE DATA with typed scalars, group headers, and nested groups
* Exercises: Type, Level, and Dimensions metadata flowing into Symbol nodes
* Tests that Detail is populated from Type/Level/Dimensions and nil for group headers

DEFINE DATA
LOCAL
  1 SIMPLE-STRING (A26)
  1 NUMERIC-FIELD (N8)
  1 PACKED-DEC (P9,2)
  1 INTEGER-VAL (I4)
  1 DYNAMIC-STRING ((A) DYNAMIC)
  1 CUSTOMER-GROUP
    2 CUSTOMER-ID (A10)
    2 CUSTOMER-NAME (A40)
    2 ADDRESS-DETAILS
      3 STREET (A50)
      3 CITY (A30)
END DEFINE

END
